{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>帶狗散步前想知道天氣是否合適？《Dog Weather》把一整面天氣數字收起來，直接給出 PERFECT、GREAT、OK 或 DON’T 的答案，並標示好天氣可維持多久、下一個理想時段何時開始。原價 US $39.99，現正終生版限時免費，適合每日帶狗外出散步的飼主。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-180.webp\">\n<h2>每小時評分找出最佳散步時段</h2>\n<p>每個小時都有評分，並自動標出全日最佳時段，點入即可看到影響分數的原因，例如過熱、大風、下雨或紫外線偏強。輸入狗狗體型、毛長與耐熱程度，以及自己的體感偏好，分數會隨之調整。除散步外，跑步、踩單車、洗車、戶外咖啡、釣魚、曬衣、遠足、野餐與攝影等十種活動各有獨立評分準則。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-210-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-211-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-212-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-213-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-214-scaled.jpg\">\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Dog Weather: Walks &amp; Widgets 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Dog Weather: Walks &amp; Widgets</li>\n<li>應用類別：Weather</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T19:37:40.625906+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":465,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T19:33:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T03:17:35.122815+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T19:36:06.101113+00:00","content_hash":"eda5a6a7ec03ebc529ea5625003a0a576a62117683555c7bb2b8734723cdc912","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}